  "_mouse_comment": "mouse:false makes the phone send no mouse events at all (taps, camera drag, pinch): an emergency switch.",
  "_hud_comment": "The Hide button removes all phone controls; the eye icon in the corner brings them back. Menu > Game interface hides the game's own UI (Alt-Z).",
  "trackpad_speed": 1.4,
  "_mousemode_comment": "Mouse button: the screen becomes a trackpad with a cursor. Slide = move, tap = left click, tap then touch-and-drag = drag, two-finger tap or long press = right click, two-finger slide = scroll. trackpad_speed sets cursor speed.",
  "_keys_comment": "Keys opens the iPhone keyboard; every key you press is pressed in the game (O, N, capital = Shift). Chat still types a chat message."
